  <item>
    <title>30 Follow your heart or not? | 2026 Q2在想什么</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae765a7c96c8942ec15ae65</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae765a7c96c8942ec15ae65</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 17:07:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本意是录制Q2在想什么，姐妹很久不见聊的很远，全长有三个多小时，努力剪辑拼凑了。</span></p><p><span>🎵Spring Rain- Oscar Dunbar</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>自我介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">0:47</a> Q2自由的瞬间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">5:28</a> 营养补剂的讨论+过去高精力的一天</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> 做个淡人</span></p><p><span>（1）信息过载/状态不好的表现，一些重新做人的动作</span></p><p><span>（2）<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a> 淡人的定义</span></p><p><span>（3）<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> 最近做的一些单人运动</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 少年心气</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> follow heart的悖论</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 靠近行为指引的人 和 单点的人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> 哄自己上班+实体购物</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2455">40:55</a> 旅游观念 / 消费观</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3800">1:03:20</a> 旅游还是吃苦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4263">1:11:03</a> 记录</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4595">1:16:35</a> 稳定与漂泊感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4836">1:20:36</a> 徒步与旅游城市</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5064">1:24:24</a> AI的应用</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5328">1:28:48</a> 心理咨询的内容</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5722">1:35:22</a> 朋友们的联系</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
