    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a4a30863fb7233cbf43ff8c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2026 10:34:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎂录制于2026.6.13 正值双双生日</span></p><p><span>没有预设太多话题，聊到哪就是哪了</span></p><p><span>🎵Komorebi-Craft Spells</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 对生日的焦虑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a> 去年2025一年干了什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a>今年要干什么/职业的转变</span></p><p><span>1. 对职业的态度的改变</span></p><p><span>2. 另一半的影响</span></p><p><span>3. 工作以外能做的其他事情</span></p><p><span>4. 关系的转变 人生方向不同，走一步算一步</span></p><p><span>///////<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1742">29:02</a>恋爱话题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1758">29:18</a> 土象星座另一半的特质</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> 一个游戏选择</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2292">38:12</a> 找对象要看什么/核心诉求</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2495">41:35</a>生娃与事业与晚婚与父母交流</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">57:30</a> 亲密关系如何相处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4265">71:05</a> 新的一岁的期待</span></p><p><span>感慨太自由了！</span></p>]]></description>
