  <item>
    <title>25 穿过暴雨，拥抱鱼尾峰 | 尼泊尔MBC三日记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69fe03f9e1eb34a9390125af</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69fe03f9e1eb34a9390125af</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 May 2026 15:54:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期记录了2026年五一假期和同行小伙伴一起在尼泊尔🇳🇵博卡拉MBC线路三日的所观所想。三天暴雨，但是很幸运的看到了鱼尾峰🏔️</span></p><p><span>🎵Keep Me-Novo Amor</span></p><p><span>🔗路线后续更新小红书链接</span></p><p><span>【第一阶段】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> Trekkers的自我介绍+怎么认识</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a> 嘉宾户外运动经验分享：</span></p><p><span>马拉松 徒步 越野跑 攀岩</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a></span></p><p><span>等一下！事发突然！i人被聊吐了🤮</span></p><p><span>（EI人的话题讨论放到最后花絮里）</span></p><p></p><p><span>【第二阶段】<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> 遇到的有趣的人/动物，包括：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> 日本帅哥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a> 加德满都的情侣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> 尼泊尔13岁妹妹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> Lynn的个人感悟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 要吃的老头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1263">21:03</a> 小黄 等小动物</span></p><p></p><p><span>【第三阶段】<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1453">24:13</a> 旅途中有趣的事/人生瞬间，包括：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a> Lynn的惊喜</span></p><p><span>坐飞机+写遗书+坚韧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a> 彩虹🌈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> 雪山🏔️</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1982">33:02</a> 一个人往前走看见神山</span></p><p><br><span>【第四阶段】<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2299">38:19</a> 不愉快的负面事件</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">38:15</a> 高反</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 大雨+永远湿润的背包，和水的不解之缘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2552">42:32</a> trek和hike的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2602">43:22</a> 蚂蝗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2868">47:48</a> low camp的善良老板</span></p><p><br></p><p><span>【第五阶段】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3268">54:28</a> 加德满都和博卡拉的区别</span></p><p><span>城市路况、交通堪忧，住宿便宜</span></p><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3801">63:21</a> MBC与印象中有什么不同</span></p><p><span>山脊线不多、国人不多、吉普车颠簸</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4088">68:08</a> 飞机延误与景点感悟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4381">73:01</a> 花絮：关于i人e人的讨论</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6671939dccb5900144499752/ltWIf6IXrw-k60ztMg_7twvnU7Gf.m4a" length="73230275" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi3R9rBfLvODtMw4WweNjz4yvcr7.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
